# Agent and editor working directories. Was .claude/worktrees/ only, which left
# the rest of .claude — settings.local.json, session state — free to be committed
# by a stray `git add .`. None of it is shared history: it is one machine's local
# tool state, and it can carry local paths and machine-specific permissions.
.claude/
.omo/
.vscode/
.idea/
